        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Salman Iqbal, Mehreen Jabbar, Abdul Razzak Yaqoob\n- Companies: ARY Films, ARY Digital Network, ARY Group, Newsweek Middle East\n- Products: Dobara Phir Se\n- Roles: CEO, owner, publisher, director, media mogul\n\nFacts:\n- Abdul Razzak Yaqoob started the ARY Group.\n- In 2014, Salman Iqbal became the CEO of ARY Digital Network after the death of Abdul Razzak Yaqoob.\n- In 2016, Dobara Phir Se was released as a Pakistani romantic drama film directed by Mehreen Jabbar and produced by ARY Films.\n- Salman Iqbal is a Pakistani media mogul.\n- Salman Iqbal is the owner of the ARY Group.\n- Salman Iqbal is the publisher of Newsweek Middle East.",
